{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_CDD3E60B","title":"Gunger futher revelations","entry":"Dlg_CDD3E60B::entry","exit":"Dlg_CDD3E60B::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_7E8A41C5","articyId":"72057645577592064","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"So it's all coming to an end huh? The Thaddeus's experiment is almost over.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So it's all coming to an end huh? The Thaddeus's experiment is almost over.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":650.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29418","byteOffset":19009152,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_75F1B804","articyId":"72057645577592077","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Can't tell you. Wish I could. Thaddeus had a secret he didn't want to share, but I really don't feel like keeping his secrets anymore.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can't tell you. Wish I could. Thaddeus had a secret he didn't want to share, but I really don't feel like keeping his secrets anymore.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1250.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29954","byteOffset":19212512,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_D14843A5","articyId":"72057645577592092","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"He gave me a gift I can't give back.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He gave me a gift I can't give back.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1850.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17000","byteOffset":14322624,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_A0E4DC73","articyId":"72057645577592106","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"He asked me to hold onto something, and I can't tell you what it is. But I can tell you I don't want it anymore. You see for you, it might be like Thaddeus is gone, but for me... it's like I can't ever get rid of him.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He asked me to hold onto something, and I can't tell you what it is. But I can tell you I don't want it anymore. You see for you, it might be like Thaddeus is gone, but for me... it's like I can't ever get rid of him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25032","byteOffset":17353160,"byteLength":564}},{"id":"DFr_AD45D1FD","articyId":"72057645577592132","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Nah. If his experiment fails, I'm stuck holding onto something that loses all meaning. If it succeeds, Thaddeus sticks around and my burden remains.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nah. If his experiment fails, I'm stuck holding onto something that loses all meaning. If it succeeds, Thaddeus sticks around and my burden remains.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46646","byteOffset":31980128,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_139244C8","articyId":"72057645577592138","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Good choice. Remember that when Thaddeus makes you the same offer he made me... I'm so fucking tired...","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1